(2110419, 288854, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice duck shot, though, the implementation of the challenge is too theoretical here. The water seems rather grey than blue. As photography is visual, it would be better if the water was blue indeed. Sorry, for me, it doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'Nice duck shot, though, the implementation of the challenge is too theoretical here. The water seems rather grey than blue. As photography is visual, it would be better if the water was blue indeed. Sorry, for me, it doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2006-02-01 12:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
