(2110468, 289417, 10858, '<td valign="top">Blue for sure, but I can''t catch the subject. The idea may be good but the implementation could be improved. If the title was not there, I really could not identify the point of view here. Also the quality is poor as you can see some harsh pixellation, especially in the corners.</td>', 'Blue for sure, but I can''t catch the subject. The idea may be good but the implementation could be improved. If the title was not there, I really could not identify the point of view here. Also the quality is poor as you can see some harsh pixellation, especially in the corners.', '2006-02-01 12:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
