(2112142, 288149, 52589, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my desktop.</td>', 'Reminds me of my desktop.', '2006-02-01 20:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112144, 287434, 44743, '<td valign="top">It''s a fun perspective-- took me a second to realize that it was a mirror, rather than 4 separate brushes.  The problem is that most everything seems out of focus.  The bottom right brush is crisp, but it takes a while for the eye to find that.</td>', 'It''s a fun perspective-- took me a second to realize that it was a mirror, rather than 4 separate brushes.  The problem is that most everything seems out of focus.  The bottom right brush is crisp, but it takes a while for the eye to find that.', '2006-02-01 20:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112146, 287840, 44743, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.  Perfect, crisp focus on the eyes.</td>', 'Nice lighting.  Perfect, crisp focus on the eyes.', '2006-02-01 20:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112154, 288096, 44743, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot!  The blue sky &amp; water contrasted with a bit of red &amp; green make a perfect entry for this challenge.  (Makes me wish I lived in San Fran.)  Hope this does well.</td>', 'Fantastic shot!  The blue sky & water contrasted with a bit of red & green make a perfect entry for this challenge.  (Makes me wish I lived in San Fran.)  Hope this does well.', '2006-02-01 20:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112162, 287875, 24528, '<td valign="top">left comment</td>', 'left comment', '2006-02-01 20:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112172, 288980, 44743, '<td valign="top">I love the idea for this shot!  A couple of concerns, though: It would be nice to have a bit more depth of field.  The closest die is in focus, but it would be nice if the others were, too.  Also, I wonder if a more neutral colored background would have made the blue dice stand out more?  All in all, a nice shot!</td>', 'I love the idea for this shot!  A couple of concerns, though: It would be nice to have a bit more depth of field.  The closest die is in focus, but it would be nice if the others were, too.  Also, I wonder if a more neutral colored background would have made the blue dice stand out more?  All in all, a nice shot!', '2006-02-01 20:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112181, 287608, 44743, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  Fun "swirl" patterns in the reflections.  Using the full 640 pixels and correcting the minor clockwise rotation would help the score a bit.</td>', 'Nice subject.  Fun "swirl" patterns in the reflections.  Using the full 640 pixels and correcting the minor clockwise rotation would help the score a bit.', '2006-02-01 20:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112201, 289159, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love it. Beautiful crystals in the foreground, and dreamy background. 10</td>', 'Love it. Beautiful crystals in the foreground, and dreamy background. 10', '2006-02-01 20:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112209, 287343, 33947, '<td valign="top">Fun treatment of the can. Like it.</td>', 'Fun treatment of the can. Like it.', '2006-02-01 20:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112224, 288750, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love the crispness and clarity. Neat colors and lighting, too. One of my favorites. 10</td>', 'Love the crispness and clarity. Neat colors and lighting, too. One of my favorites. 10', '2006-02-01 20:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112227, 286157, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, soft lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful, soft lighting.', '2006-02-01 20:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112270, 289289, 33947, '<td valign="top">Fantastic lighting and line. 10</td>', 'Fantastic lighting and line. 10', '2006-02-01 20:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112293, 288841, 48224, '<td valign="top">It is a decent abstract. The border seems to be a little distracting though...</td>', 'It is a decent abstract. The border seems to be a little distracting though...', '2006-02-01 20:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112353, 287434, 48224, '<td valign="top">Well, there is blue in the image so at least it meets the challenge. To be blunt though...it is a bad image. It is out of focus, the lighting is very harsh and the highlights are blown out. There is also really nothing appealing about the composition.</td>', 'Well, there is blue in the image so at least it meets the challenge. To be blunt though...it is a bad image. It is out of focus, the lighting is very harsh and the highlights are blown out. There is also really nothing appealing about the composition.', '2006-02-01 21:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112385, 288261, 43437, '<td valign="top">very very nice!  A little more sharpness on the mtn but probably impossible to do for Basic.  Crisper waves too.  Very good colors though.</td>', 'very very nice!  A little more sharpness on the mtn but probably impossible to do for Basic.  Crisper waves too.  Very good colors though.', '2006-02-01 21:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112394, 287158, 31831, '<td valign="top">This is great.</td>', 'This is great.', '2006-02-01 21:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112395, 288785, 33392, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Not overpowered by shadows - crisp.  I''m not wild about the blue border - I think it detracts from the picture.  Did you try black?  The blue, being lighter than the other blues in the photo draws my eye away from the subject.</td>', 'Very well done.  Not overpowered by shadows - crisp.  I''m not wild about the blue border - I think it detracts from the picture.  Did you try black?  The blue, being lighter than the other blues in the photo draws my eye away from the subject.', '2006-02-01 21:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112396, 287343, 51802, '<td valign="top">Is this really a photo of a can?  It seems too flat.</td>', 'Is this really a photo of a can?  It seems too flat.', '2006-02-01 21:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112412, 287343, 51614, '<td valign="top">Err, not very blue... but I love the picture</td>', 'Err, not very blue... but I love the picture', '2006-02-01 21:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2112415, 288697, 48224, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a little soft and it would probably be better if you got the white background to actually be white. Are the things in the shot glass blueberries? They are much to dark to be able to get any hint of color from them. The composition is overall a little static. All the elements being lined up and completely seperated from each other tends to be a little boring.</td>', 'Focus seems a little soft and it would probably be better if you got the white background to actually be white. Are the things in the shot glass blueberries? They are much to dark to be able to get any hint of color from them. The composition is overall a little static. All the elements being lined up and completely seperated from each other tends to be a little boring.', '2006-02-01 21:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
