(2112958, 287415, 31812, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action. There are a couple of flecks of shadow that distract from the shot a little, but nice job overall.</td>', 'Nice stop action. There are a couple of flecks of shadow that distract from the shot a little, but nice job overall.', '2006-02-01 23:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
