(2113175, 288393, 17507, '<td valign="top">very graphic-design feel to it - I like it. interesting title.</td>', 'very graphic-design feel to it - I like it. interesting title.', '2006-02-02 00:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113178, 289030, 17507, '<td valign="top">what''s there is great, but it needs something at the bottom! there''s a thin line there that looks like it wants to be something... and I want it to be something... but it''s not. The blues and whites are very well rendered here - the lighting is good and the picture is sharp - it''s just that to my eye, it''s compositionally unbalanced.</td>', 'what''s there is great, but it needs something at the bottom! there''s a thin line there that looks like it wants to be something... and I want it to be something... but it''s not. The blues and whites are very well rendered here - the lighting is good and the picture is sharp - it''s just that to my eye, it''s compositionally unbalanced.', '2006-02-02 00:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113183, 286859, 24528, '<td valign="top">Hope you find it!!! Cause I did''nt</td>', 'Hope you find it!!! Cause I did''nt', '2006-02-02 00:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113199, 288470, 48890, '<td valign="top">Fantastic crop, good picture clarity.  Very simple and tasteful.  10</td>', 'Fantastic crop, good picture clarity.  Very simple and tasteful.  10', '2006-02-02 00:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
