(2113272, 287419, 6388, '<td valign="top">very nicely done.  i''d love to see her eyes brought up a bit, but that''s pretty tough when you can''t dodge or do any selective editing.  love the crop and the background frames her beautifully  nice work</td>', 'very nicely done.  i''d love to see her eyes brought up a bit, but that''s pretty tough when you can''t dodge or do any selective editing.  love the crop and the background frames her beautifully  nice work', '2006-02-02 00:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113273, 287226, 17507, '<td valign="top">nice portrait of this young man. and thank you for not including "blue" in the title.</td>', 'nice portrait of this young man. and thank you for not including "blue" in the title.', '2006-02-02 00:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113277, 287668, 17507, '<td valign="top">soggy genie!</td>', 'soggy genie!', '2006-02-02 00:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113285, 289308, 17507, '<td valign="top">very interesting choice of subject - I have several of these things lying around somewhere, and I''ve always thought that they look cool. your lighting is way harsh, though... have you ever tried constructing a soft box? this can be as easy as propping up a large plastic bag with a couple of pieces of cardboard. then just stick your subject inside this bag and point a light through the bag. you''ll get a much softer light that way that renders good shadows and detail.</td>', 'very interesting choice of subject - I have several of these things lying around somewhere, and I''ve always thought that they look cool. your lighting is way harsh, though... have you ever tried constructing a soft box? this can be as easy as propping up a large plastic bag with a couple of pieces of cardboard. then just stick your subject inside this bag and point a light through the bag. you''ll get a much softer light that way that renders good shadows and detail.', '2006-02-02 00:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113286, 287307, 17507, '<td valign="top">wow, nice burn :)</td>', 'wow, nice burn :)', '2006-02-02 00:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113289, 288854, 17507, '<td valign="top">this isn''t even remotely blue. I even put this image into photoshop and desaturated the blues, and the image doesn''t change at all. It seems like you went out of your way to <i>avoid</i> meeting the challenge. I don''t know why you would do that.</td>', 'this isn''t even remotely blue. I even put this image into photoshop and desaturated the blues, and the image doesn''t change at all. It seems like you went out of your way to avoid meeting the challenge. I don''t know why you would do that.', '2006-02-02 00:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2113299, 288679, 17507, '<td valign="top">my subjective opinion: with this photograph, you have disgraced your model</td>', 'my subjective opinion: with this photograph, you have disgraced your model', '2006-02-02 00:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
