(2114056, 288129, 52387, '<td valign="top">Good subject matter, and good composition. Personally, I''d rather see the bird more natural, but I am also intrigued by what you did here.</td>', 'Good subject matter, and good composition. Personally, I''d rather see the bird more natural, but I am also intrigued by what you did here.', '2006-02-02 09:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
