(2114068, 288238, 24454, '<td valign="top">One word:  WOW!  Ok. .more than one word:  this is so absolutely awesome.  If this had been advanced editing, the only thing that would have added to making this a gallery piece would be removing the power lines and a couple of those obstructions, but since it was basic editing, this could not be improved upon!  It is MY kind of picture!!!  10</td>', 'One word:  WOW!  Ok. .more than one word:  this is so absolutely awesome.  If this had been advanced editing, the only thing that would have added to making this a gallery piece would be removing the power lines and a couple of those obstructions, but since it was basic editing, this could not be improved upon!  It is MY kind of picture!!!  10', '2006-02-02 09:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2114069, 287323, 52387, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but the mountain is too dead on straight. Move to one side or the other, or zoom out and then do so.</td>', 'Nice subject, but the mountain is too dead on straight. Move to one side or the other, or zoom out and then do so.', '2006-02-02 09:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
