(2117736, 288515, 10858, '<td valign="top">I have been always trying around to shoot glass sharp, I think I will take lessons from you. :-) Great, clear shot with composition and lighting spot on, the subject is also interesting and I like the indigo shade blues very much. I am really curoius what this is and how it was done. Good luck!</td>', 'I have been always trying around to shoot glass sharp, I think I will take lessons from you. :-) Great, clear shot with composition and lighting spot on, the subject is also interesting and I like the indigo shade blues very much. I am really curoius what this is and how it was done. Good luck!', '2006-02-03 10:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117745, 288843, 10858, '<td valign="top">Anything this is, it''s quite out of focus. The shades are nice but the subject seems a bit conceptless. The subject you choose could be implemented with smoke lightened with blue, it''s easier to get a sharp shot by manual focus or by focusing to a solid object first, which is removed for the shot.</td>', 'Anything this is, it''s quite out of focus. The shades are nice but the subject seems a bit conceptless. The subject you choose could be implemented with smoke lightened with blue, it''s easier to get a sharp shot by manual focus or by focusing to a solid object first, which is removed for the shot.', '2006-02-03 10:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117761, 287641, 10858, '<td valign="top">Another chaos shot... Not sure about the empty wrappings would work well. It also seems overexposed, and not an interesting subject either, sorry.</td>', 'Another chaos shot... Not sure about the empty wrappings would work well. It also seems overexposed, and not an interesting subject either, sorry.', '2006-02-03 10:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117769, 288737, 10858, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been better if it was shot with a tripod. Your hand must have been shaken durong the exposure, which mades it unclear, and the spots are a bit distracting. Is it snow falling?</td>', 'I think this could have been better if it was shot with a tripod. Your hand must have been shaken durong the exposure, which mades it unclear, and the spots are a bit distracting. Is it snow falling?', '2006-02-03 10:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117770, 286299, 10858, '<td valign="top">Blue Chaos? It''s difficult to make a good chaos composition. I can''t find the concept here, neither the purpose of cropping. Lighting could be improved, too. One of my favourite sayings is: "Less may be more." I feel this is true for this one: choose a single subject but make it perfect.</td>', 'Blue Chaos? It''s difficult to make a good chaos composition. I can''t find the concept here, neither the purpose of cropping. Lighting could be improved, too. One of my favourite sayings is: "Less may be more." I feel this is true for this one: choose a single subject but make it perfect.', '2006-02-03 10:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117773, 288591, 10858, '<td valign="top">I feel like being a bit out of focus here, and also there is some irregular distortion of white balance. It''s funny and meets the challenge, but still, the subject and the implementation both miss something...</td>', 'I feel like being a bit out of focus here, and also there is some irregular distortion of white balance. It''s funny and meets the challenge, but still, the subject and the implementation both miss something...', '2006-02-03 10:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117774, 287434, 10858, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, though it''s very much out of focus and overexposed, which makes in unenjoyable. Don''t push the camera into the subject if it does not support macro mode, because you will loose focus.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, though it''s very much out of focus and overexposed, which makes in unenjoyable. Don''t push the camera into the subject if it does not support macro mode, because you will loose focus.', '2006-02-03 10:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117787, 286752, 10858, '<td valign="top">You loose some details during this shot, which may come both from the lighting or expoure. The composition is nice, though it looks unnatural blue. WB is a nice tool to help you in this race, but I think it was overused here.</td>', 'You loose some details during this shot, which may come both from the lighting or expoure. The composition is nice, though it looks unnatural blue. WB is a nice tool to help you in this race, but I think it was overused here.', '2006-02-03 10:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117788, 289256, 43519, '<td valign="top">Nice and minimalist, a stronger contrast will have strengthened the image. 7</td>', 'Nice and minimalist, a stronger contrast will have strengthened the image. 7', '2006-02-03 10:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117796, 286486, 43519, '<td valign="top">It is great, but why you did not use colorant to colour the milk, the effect will have turned great. 6</td>', 'It is great, but why you did not use colorant to colour the milk, the effect will have turned great. 6', '2006-02-03 10:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117799, 288095, 43519, '<td valign="top">Good, but deja vu. 6</td>', 'Good, but deja vu. 6', '2006-02-03 10:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
