(2117809, 289153, 10858, '<td valign="top">Composition needs more concept and the use of flash did some blow outs and unnatural colours on the leaves. If I were you, I would not insist on making blue of things which don''t really look good blue. Or, if you like this subject, a dark environment and some blue lighting sources would help you. My submission was done with a white subject, I think white is the most likely colour to be able manipulated by white balance or colourful light sources.</td>', 'Composition needs more concept and the use of flash did some blow outs and unnatural colours on the leaves. If I were you, I would not insist on making blue of things which don''t really look good blue. Or, if you like this subject, a dark environment and some blue lighting sources would help you. My submission was done with a white subject, I think white is the most likely colour to be able manipulated by white balance or colourful light sources.', '2006-02-03 10:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117817, 286843, 43519, '<td valign="top">nice, but I think that kind of pictures are deja vu. 6</td>', 'nice, but I think that kind of pictures are deja vu. 6', '2006-02-03 10:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117818, 288868, 43519, '<td valign="top">good. but deja vu...not very imaginative in my opinion. 6</td>', 'good. but deja vu...not very imaginative in my opinion. 6', '2006-02-03 10:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117820, 288982, 10858, '<td valign="top">Seems overexposed and quite unnatural. I can''t really see the point of composition here, the subject of your photo. Indeed it''s blue, but blue should be a likely feature of your subject or tell us some more about the subject you choose. I think the purpose of the colour is important in this challenge.</td>', 'Seems overexposed and quite unnatural. I can''t really see the point of composition here, the subject of your photo. Indeed it''s blue, but blue should be a likely feature of your subject or tell us some more about the subject you choose. I think the purpose of the colour is important in this challenge.', '2006-02-03 10:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117822, 287279, 43519, '<td valign="top">An orignal picture with a minimalist effect. Good composition. 8</td>', 'An orignal picture with a minimalist effect. Good composition. 8', '2006-02-03 10:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117824, 288426, 10858, '<td valign="top">It would be better to show more of the baby''s beautiful blue eye, and less skin and background. It''s difficult to photograph babies, they never do what you say. But, IMO, lighting could be improved in order to gain better skin tones, and the eye could be even sharper.</td>', 'It would be better to show more of the baby''s beautiful blue eye, and less skin and background. It''s difficult to photograph babies, they never do what you say. But, IMO, lighting could be improved in order to gain better skin tones, and the eye could be even sharper.', '2006-02-03 10:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117825, 289315, 10858, '<td valign="top">Isn''t really a clear shot, and I can''t see the matter of the subject. The almost diagonal composition is conscious, but the subject is nothing that could take the viewer with. Maybe you should choose a more different viewpoint here.</td>', 'Isn''t really a clear shot, and I can''t see the matter of the subject. The almost diagonal composition is conscious, but the subject is nothing that could take the viewer with. Maybe you should choose a more different viewpoint here.', '2006-02-03 10:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117829, 288947, 43519, '<td valign="top">I think I have already seen this picture somewhere. Did I</td>', 'I think I have already seen this picture somewhere. Did I', '2006-02-03 10:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117830, 288467, 10858, '<td valign="top">Quite out of focus, and overlighted. Try to find focus, that''s very important and diffuse lights. The subject could be placed further from the background, this way you could blow out whites without getting strong shadows. Sorry, the quality is quite poor here, but don''t give up, the more you try, the better result you will have.</td>', 'Quite out of focus, and overlighted. Try to find focus, that''s very important and diffuse lights. The subject could be placed further from the background, this way you could blow out whites without getting strong shadows. Sorry, the quality is quite poor here, but don''t give up, the more you try, the better result you will have.', '2006-02-03 10:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117832, 289398, 43519, '<td valign="top">Deja vu, but the quality is there. The gradients are just perfect in this picture. 9</td>', 'Deja vu, but the quality is there. The gradients are just perfect in this picture. 9', '2006-02-03 10:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117843, 289238, 43519, '<td valign="top">very nice composition. 8</td>', 'very nice composition. 8', '2006-02-03 10:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117845, 289246, 10858, '<td valign="top">A blue ball snapshot with flash... There are stripes on this ball, try to play around with them! It could be a main character of the composition. And the photo needs more light, and more diffused light IMO. Compact camera flashes are hardly good enough for lighting.</td>', 'A blue ball snapshot with flash... There are stripes on this ball, try to play around with them! It could be a main character of the composition. And the photo needs more light, and more diffused light IMO. Compact camera flashes are hardly good enough for lighting.', '2006-02-03 10:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117846, 287343, 10858, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what you really made to the colours, but it doesn''t have a positive effect averall. It ruins the quality, and it''s rather purple than blue. It would be better to find a blue can, and avoid such agressive (and destructive) post-process.</td>', 'I don''t know what you really made to the colours, but it doesn''t have a positive effect averall. It ruins the quality, and it''s rather purple than blue. It would be better to find a blue can, and avoid such agressive (and destructive) post-process.', '2006-02-03 10:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117847, 287186, 10858, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this is rather purple than blue, and it''s quite out of focus. Also the aberration on the edge of the petals is distracting. Yellow adds a nice colour element, though.</td>', 'Sorry, this is rather purple than blue, and it''s quite out of focus. Also the aberration on the edge of the petals is distracting. Yellow adds a nice colour element, though.', '2006-02-03 10:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117859, 287826, 10858, '<td valign="top">Quite out of focus, and I can''t see the concept of the composition. Blue, it''s true, but try to implement your subject in a way that raises the viewers'' interest for your subject. It''s not only blue what''s important for this challenge, but the subject you choose to show blue, and the implementation, the hows of making your shot.</td>', 'Quite out of focus, and I can''t see the concept of the composition. Blue, it''s true, but try to implement your subject in a way that raises the viewers'' interest for your subject. It''s not only blue what''s important for this challenge, but the subject you choose to show blue, and the implementation, the hows of making your shot.', '2006-02-03 10:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2117866, 287532, 43519, '<td valign="top">I like it, where was the picture taken? Let me know about the artist. The style is kind of unique. 9</td>', 'I like it, where was the picture taken? Let me know about the artist. The style is kind of unique. 9', '2006-02-03 10:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
