(2117886, 288640, 43519, '<td valign="top">OK, that is a good picture. But, unfortunately, there is some flares. Maybe more contrast will have given a more punchy picture. Did you use a circular polarizer? That would have been an excellent picture. White and Blue is generally a good combination. I give you 8. Partly because you diserve it, partly because most pictures that I saw lack of originality. Good Job!</td>', 'OK, that is a good picture. But, unfortunately, there is some flares. Maybe more contrast will have given a more punchy picture. Did you use a circular polarizer? That would have been an excellent picture. White and Blue is generally a good combination. I give you 8. Partly because you diserve it, partly because most pictures that I saw lack of originality. Good Job!', '2006-02-03 10:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
