(2119024, 289246, 44490, '<td valign="top">Elegant idea.  The overall subject is just to simple, an additional element would help.  Focus on center would be better, maybe you were too close for your combination of camera/lens.</td>', 'Elegant idea.  The overall subject is just to simple, an additional element would help.  Focus on center would be better, maybe you were too close for your combination of camera/lens.', '2006-02-03 16:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
