(2119065, 287875, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes and colors.  But the image suffers from lack of sharpness, perhaps you were too close for your camera/lens?  Backup to the minimum focus distance and crop in software.</td>', 'Nice shapes and colors.  But the image suffers from lack of sharpness, perhaps you were too close for your camera/lens?  Backup to the minimum focus distance and crop in software.', '2006-02-03 16:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
