(2119418, 288318, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  This is one of those rare cases where inverting the image might help, especially with your title.  Usually, most of us will be looking for something clearer, so just a reflection is risky.</td>', 'Nice idea.  This is one of those rare cases where inverting the image might help, especially with your title.  Usually, most of us will be looking for something clearer, so just a reflection is risky.', '2006-02-03 18:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
