(2119437, 286640, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and striking image.  Too bad it is blurry - sharper and clearer would be better.</td>', 'Nice idea and striking image.  Too bad it is blurry - sharper and clearer would be better.', '2006-02-03 18:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
