(2120233, 287323, 33982, '<td valign="top">ouch ..toooooo sharp</td>', 'ouch ..toooooo sharp', '2006-02-03 22:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120237, 286093, 52387, '<td valign="top">This is a dramatic image; well done. The colors are very nice.</td>', 'This is a dramatic image; well done. The colors are very nice.', '2006-02-03 22:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120287, 286410, 52387, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but it has no soul.</td>', 'Interesting composition, but it has no soul.', '2006-02-03 22:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120291, 289271, 52387, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t say much to me. Probably my fault. The colors of the flame are pretty, though.</td>', 'It doesn''t say much to me. Probably my fault. The colors of the flame are pretty, though.', '2006-02-03 22:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120295, 288882, 52387, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. I think the fact that I can''t see the point of the boat throws my eyes off. It becomes more abstract, and yes, it has some interest. I like the weathered look.</td>', 'Hmmm. I think the fact that I can''t see the point of the boat throws my eyes off. It becomes more abstract, and yes, it has some interest. I like the weathered look.', '2006-02-03 22:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120298, 288470, 52387, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. I think you have looked up at them before.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. I think you have looked up at them before.', '2006-02-03 22:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120302, 287974, 52387, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is the case, or it''s just reflections, but this reminds me of a certain glaze that makes radial patterns of lines, very, very pretty. So my eyes greeted this one well.</td>', 'I don''t know if this is the case, or it''s just reflections, but this reminds me of a certain glaze that makes radial patterns of lines, very, very pretty. So my eyes greeted this one well.', '2006-02-03 22:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120304, 288302, 52387, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty picture. There isn''t much blue in it, though.</td>', 'This is a pretty picture. There isn''t much blue in it, though.', '2006-02-03 23:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120469, 289030, 48326, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, but kind of a boring subject</td>', 'Nice lighting, but kind of a boring subject', '2006-02-04 00:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120588, 288653, 52589, '<td valign="top">Almost a duotone...</td>', 'Almost a duotone...', '2006-02-04 01:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120756, 289377, 21216, '<td valign="top">A picture with a lot of potential unfortuanetly it lacks a lot of contrast to make it pop</td>', 'A picture with a lot of potential unfortuanetly it lacks a lot of contrast to make it pop', '2006-02-04 03:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120799, 288750, 41163, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of colors, especially the yellow background. Just wish you had lighted this a little more. Composition is great as well. 7.</td>', 'Nice choice of colors, especially the yellow background. Just wish you had lighted this a little more. Composition is great as well. 7.', '2006-02-04 05:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120805, 289244, 41163, '<td valign="top">Great photojournalism. 9.</td>', 'Great photojournalism. 9.', '2006-02-04 05:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120818, 288095, 41163, '<td valign="top">Very clean take on .. classic subject. ;o) 7.</td>', 'Very clean take on .. classic subject. ;o) 7.', '2006-02-04 06:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120843, 288697, 14614, '<td valign="top">try putting your elements into a different arrangement -- they look like they''re in a "line up", less equi-distant, vary spacing between them.  Your lighting is too flat/dim to bring out the depth of the elements.</td>', 'try putting your elements into a different arrangement -- they look like they''re in a "line up", less equi-distant, vary spacing between them.  Your lighting is too flat/dim to bring out the depth of the elements.', '2006-02-04 06:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120906, 288841, 35720, '<td valign="top">Great shot, one of the best in this challenge, and I think I know who took it. Good luck!</td>', 'Great shot, one of the best in this challenge, and I think I know who took it. Good luck!', '2006-02-04 07:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120924, 288127, 45919, '<td valign="top">It''s Blue, but despite staring at it for a while, I can''t actually tell what it is...</td>', 'It''s Blue, but despite staring at it for a while, I can''t actually tell what it is...', '2006-02-04 07:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120926, 286010, 45919, '<td valign="top">I love the reflections, Apple could be paying you for this one!</td>', 'I love the reflections, Apple could be paying you for this one!', '2006-02-04 07:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120927, 287307, 43869, '<td valign="top">LOL!</td>', 'LOL!', '2006-02-04 07:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120934, 286410, 45919, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, love the angles and the constrasts in the blues...  Like the reflections both in the mirror and on the shiny paintwork of the mirror.  Well done...</td>', 'Nice photo, love the angles and the constrasts in the blues...  Like the reflections both in the mirror and on the shiny paintwork of the mirror.  Well done...', '2006-02-04 07:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2120988, 289233, 42198, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Pity the flower she''s touching isn''t blue! - Also, her wings blend into the background a bit. But overall, I love it.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Pity the flower she''s touching isn''t blue! - Also, her wings blend into the background a bit. But overall, I love it.', '2006-02-04 08:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121017, 289289, 22937, '<td valign="top">Woow, what a shape. However, the illuminated fundament(?) and the white dots distracts a bit IMHO.</td>', 'Woow, what a shape. However, the illuminated fundament(?) and the white dots distracts a bit IMHO.', '2006-02-04 08:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121185, 288059, 48890, '<td valign="top">Okay, you photographed somebody else''s graphic design, but where is *your* work here, as a photographer?</td>', 'Okay, you photographed somebody else''s graphic design, but where is *your* work here, as a photographer?', '2006-02-04 10:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121186, 287331, 48890, '<td valign="top">A very cool idea, well photographed and composed.</td>', 'A very cool idea, well photographed and composed.', '2006-02-04 10:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121188, 288841, 48890, '<td valign="top">What the hell is this?  A very intrigueing, interesting picture.</td>', 'What the hell is this?  A very intrigueing, interesting picture.', '2006-02-04 10:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121196, 288667, 48890, '<td valign="top">This subject has a lot of potential for interesting compositions, but this one doesn''t work for me, sorry.</td>', 'This subject has a lot of potential for interesting compositions, but this one doesn''t work for me, sorry.', '2006-02-04 10:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121201, 289266, 48890, '<td valign="top">Great, courageous idea.  I like this shot a lot!</td>', 'Great, courageous idea.  I like this shot a lot!', '2006-02-04 10:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121204, 289193, 48890, '<td valign="top">A very nice subject, the shot is well exposed.  The composition doesn''t quite work well, and is a bit messy IMO. 7</td>', 'A very nice subject, the shot is well exposed.  The composition doesn''t quite work well, and is a bit messy IMO. 7', '2006-02-04 10:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121209, 289100, 48326, '<td valign="top">You might try a less harsh light. It is a little washed out with harsh shadows.</td>', 'You might try a less harsh light. It is a little washed out with harsh shadows.', '2006-02-04 10:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121216, 288149, 48890, '<td valign="top">Simplicity doesn''t automatically make a great picture.  Wile I love minimalism in photography, a good minimalist shot should nave *something* of interes in it (and very little else).  Sorry to say this, but to mee this photograph is boring.  IMO even if you tilted your camera in a creative way, you could make a better shot with this same subject.</td>', 'Simplicity doesn''t automatically make a great picture.  Wile I love minimalism in photography, a good minimalist shot should nave *something* of interes in it (and very little else).  Sorry to say this, but to mee this photograph is boring.  IMO even if you tilted your camera in a creative way, you could make a better shot with this same subject.', '2006-02-04 10:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121345, 288253, 50674, '<td valign="top">Good composition, very simple, but then again, less is more :-) I very often go for different lines (ropes, strings etc.) Like it a lot.</td>', 'Good composition, very simple, but then again, less is more :-) I very often go for different lines (ropes, strings etc.) Like it a lot.', '2006-02-04 12:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121347, 288244, 50674, '<td valign="top">So simple and says it all. Good idea, well done.</td>', 'So simple and says it all. Good idea, well done.', '2006-02-04 12:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121351, 289092, 50674, '<td valign="top">More like a stolen look :-) Good light, I like it when you can almost see something in the dark.</td>', 'More like a stolen look :-) Good light, I like it when you can almost see something in the dark.', '2006-02-04 12:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121389, 288149, 50750, '<td valign="top">Nice color, but I think there is a little too much sky.  Maybe placing the horizon at the bottom third would have been better.</td>', 'Nice color, but I think there is a little too much sky.  Maybe placing the horizon at the bottom third would have been better.', '2006-02-04 12:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121394, 288820, 43434, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting picture.  THe first chimney meets vertical thirds and the second meets horizontal which is a good hit for this crop.  Which brings me to the crop -I think it may have needed a little more sky above the roof, although that may bring in the wire that I can see in the left top corner.  I think this is an interesting picture and I think will be interesting to know the post processing steps ... a good start on an almost first entry.  (I gave it a 6)</td>', 'This is an interesting picture.  THe first chimney meets vertical thirds and the second meets horizontal which is a good hit for this crop.  Which brings me to the crop -I think it may have needed a little more sky above the roof, although that may bring in the wire that I can see in the left top corner.  I think this is an interesting picture and I think will be interesting to know the post processing steps ... a good start on an almost first entry.  (I gave it a 6)', '2006-02-04 12:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121576, 287277, 50674, '<td valign="top">Well, first of all. This being a Basic Editing, I can''t wait to hear what you did to it. What a catch. It is a joy to look at the different angles, they seem so right. And then the colours, lovely blue and then the red to make a wonderful contrast. It gives the blue extra depth. Reflections add icing to the cake. Well done.</td>', 'Well, first of all. This being a Basic Editing, I can''t wait to hear what you did to it. What a catch. It is a joy to look at the different angles, they seem so right. And then the colours, lovely blue and then the red to make a wonderful contrast. It gives the blue extra depth. Reflections add icing to the cake. Well done.', '2006-02-04 14:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121578, 287852, 50674, '<td valign="top">Blue being the keyword, I like the addition of water to the ''blueness''. Maybe some additional cropping, but then a again, maybe not. Good work.</td>', 'Blue being the keyword, I like the addition of water to the ''blueness''. Maybe some additional cropping, but then a again, maybe not. Good work.', '2006-02-04 14:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121660, 289168, 38411, '<td valign="top">I didnt see the face at first.  Excellent!</td>', 'I didnt see the face at first.  Excellent!', '2006-02-04 15:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121662, 287522, 38411, '<td valign="top">The focus and blown highlight are distracting.</td>', 'The focus and blown highlight are distracting.', '2006-02-04 15:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121663, 288711, 38411, '<td valign="top">We get great sun dogs in Flagstaff.  Ive yet to get a good photo though.</td>', 'We get great sun dogs in Flagstaff.  Ive yet to get a good photo though.', '2006-02-04 15:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121670, 288033, 20856, '<td valign="top">Very theatrical, I like it.</td>', 'Very theatrical, I like it.', '2006-02-04 15:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121674, 287226, 38411, '<td valign="top">Great high key image.  Good expression.</td>', 'Great high key image.  Good expression.', '2006-02-04 15:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121780, 287298, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been much more dramatic had the background been a bright complimentary color.</td>', 'I think this would have been much more dramatic had the background been a bright complimentary color.', '2006-02-04 16:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121785, 287277, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the red of the tail light amdist all that blue.  Might have been cool to have red balloons as well.</td>', 'I like the red of the tail light amdist all that blue.  Might have been cool to have red balloons as well.', '2006-02-04 16:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121788, 286947, 30982, '<td valign="top">Would have worked nicely in Abstract as well.</td>', 'Would have worked nicely in Abstract as well.', '2006-02-04 16:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121792, 287649, 46870, '<td valign="top">realy nice love it</td>', 'realy nice love it', '2006-02-04 16:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121804, 286563, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this image.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this image.', '2006-02-04 16:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121805, 288949, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice balance to this picture.</td>', 'Very nice balance to this picture.', '2006-02-04 16:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121813, 288766, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space and DOF.  Meets the blue part, too.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space and DOF.  Meets the blue part, too.', '2006-02-04 17:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121828, 287574, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro and good interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice macro and good interpretation of the challenge.', '2006-02-04 17:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121834, 286386, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s definitely blue, but artificial-looking and not especially well-balanced.</td>', 'It''s definitely blue, but artificial-looking and not especially well-balanced.', '2006-02-04 17:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121841, 289015, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good interpretation of the challenge.  Very nice detail, good composition.</td>', 'Good interpretation of the challenge.  Very nice detail, good composition.', '2006-02-04 17:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121843, 288675, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good frame/crop.</td>', 'Good frame/crop.', '2006-02-04 17:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121847, 288409, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit sharper focus and this would be a better picture.  Good balance as far as where the bird is in the picture.</td>', 'A bit sharper focus and this would be a better picture.  Good balance as far as where the bird is in the picture.', '2006-02-04 17:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121850, 286010, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the reflections.</td>', 'Nice use of the reflections.', '2006-02-04 17:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121858, 287323, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'Looks a bit oversharpened.', '2006-02-04 17:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121861, 288328, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cool use of a fisheye (I assume).</td>', 'Cool use of a fisheye (I assume).', '2006-02-04 17:12:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2121864, 287722, 30982, '<td valign="top">Would work nicely for an ad, though the shadow is a bit strong.  Very blue!</td>', 'Would work nicely for an ad, though the shadow is a bit strong.  Very blue!', '2006-02-04 17:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121883, 288370, 30982, '<td valign="top">Clean lines, nice angle, and very blue.</td>', 'Clean lines, nice angle, and very blue.', '2006-02-04 17:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121894, 286410, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is very nicely composed.  I can see little jagged lines along teh top of the car, though.  Not sure if this is an artifact of sharpening or not.</td>', 'This is very nicely composed.  I can see little jagged lines along teh top of the car, though.  Not sure if this is an artifact of sharpening or not.', '2006-02-04 17:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121896, 288667, 30982, '<td valign="top">Unique perspective!</td>', 'Unique perspective!', '2006-02-04 17:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121899, 288641, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it is or not, but it appears to be upside down.</td>', 'Not sure if it is or not, but it appears to be upside down.', '2006-02-04 17:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121901, 287570, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, good execution.</td>', 'Very good idea, good execution.', '2006-02-04 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121903, 287312, 30982, '<td valign="top">The yellow light makes this picture "pop".</td>', 'The yellow light makes this picture "pop".', '2006-02-04 17:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121905, 288568, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good perspective and balance.</td>', 'Very good perspective and balance.', '2006-02-04 17:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121907, 287260, 30982, '<td valign="top">The hand looks to be a somewhat unnatural color.  The pose and cropping are good.</td>', 'The hand looks to be a somewhat unnatural color.  The pose and cropping are good.', '2006-02-04 17:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121909, 288149, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks a little like the Windows XP background.</td>', 'Looks a little like the Windows XP background.', '2006-02-04 17:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121911, 289037, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous detail.  Warmth of the red nicely offsets the blue.</td>', 'Gorgeous detail.  Warmth of the red nicely offsets the blue.', '2006-02-04 17:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121913, 288201, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good balance of the flowers in the frame.  The droplets appear almost like they''re on the camera lens.  A bit sharper focus on the front flower would improve this picture.</td>', 'Good balance of the flowers in the frame.  The droplets appear almost like they''re on the camera lens.  A bit sharper focus on the front flower would improve this picture.', '2006-02-04 17:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121917, 288822, 30982, '<td valign="top">Where there should be sharp lines (car, tree) I see jagged edges.  I can''t tell you for sure why they''re there.  You may want to ask in a forum after the challenge.</td>', 'Where there should be sharp lines (car, tree) I see jagged edges.  I can''t tell you for sure why they''re there.  You may want to ask in a forum after the challenge.', '2006-02-04 17:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121918, 289377, 30982, '<td valign="top">Having just the eye and no other clearly discernible features is a bit disconcerting.  I trust this is a bird?</td>', 'Having just the eye and no other clearly discernible features is a bit disconcerting.  I trust this is a bird?', '2006-02-04 17:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121925, 288479, 30982, '<td valign="top">A pretty studio setup as far as lighting - may want to put the wine bottle and glass on a different line (ie one more forward than the other instead of in the same plane) and crop a little tighter on the right and the top.</td>', 'A pretty studio setup as far as lighting - may want to put the wine bottle and glass on a different line (ie one more forward than the other instead of in the same plane) and crop a little tighter on the right and the top.', '2006-02-04 17:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121928, 289399, 30982, '<td valign="top">Colors appear somewhat unnatural.</td>', 'Colors appear somewhat unnatural.', '2006-02-04 17:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121930, 288647, 30982, '<td valign="top">Cute guy, but the picture overall is too dark, and yes, too blue.  That''s just my taste, though.  Detail is very good.</td>', 'Cute guy, but the picture overall is too dark, and yes, too blue.  That''s just my taste, though.  Detail is very good.', '2006-02-04 17:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121934, 287055, 30982, '<td valign="top">The face is a little too red.</td>', 'The face is a little too red.', '2006-02-04 17:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121937, 288238, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely gives the feeling of "cold"!  Nice balance in the angle of the road and the placement of the church in the picture.</td>', 'Definitely gives the feeling of "cold"!  Nice balance in the angle of the road and the placement of the church in the picture.', '2006-02-04 17:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2121941, 286700, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how you put in some contrast, but the rest is so close in tone that it almost looks fake - like a pepper in front of a picture.  If the blue objects had a wider variety of blue tones, it might work better.</td>', 'I like how you put in some contrast, but the rest is so close in tone that it almost looks fake - like a pepper in front of a picture.  If the blue objects had a wider variety of blue tones, it might work better.', '2006-02-04 17:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
