(2123311, 287742, 44611, '<td valign="top">Blue sky alone, even with good contrasting white clouds, is rather limited subject matter.  Perhaps if you had focused on the tree tops a bit more, even included some more of the trees this shot may have had more interest.</td>', 'Blue sky alone, even with good contrasting white clouds, is rather limited subject matter.  Perhaps if you had focused on the tree tops a bit more, even included some more of the trees this shot may have had more interest.', '2006-02-05 02:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123317, 287524, 44611, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft; uneven background is distracting from the main subject; off-centred placement of the blueberry would have improved the overall composition and the lighting is very harsh.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft; uneven background is distracting from the main subject; off-centred placement of the blueberry would have improved the overall composition and the lighting is very harsh.', '2006-02-05 02:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123323, 289092, 44611, '<td valign="top">Too vague a connection with the challenge topic - blue eyes (not even the main focus of the image) and a blue-ish background are too tenuous.  Good off-centre composition though.</td>', 'Too vague a connection with the challenge topic - blue eyes (not even the main focus of the image) and a blue-ish background are too tenuous.  Good off-centre composition though.', '2006-02-05 02:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123325, 288665, 44611, '<td valign="top">There''s just too much else going on in this shot for the blue to really leap out as the subject.  A closer crop, or zooming in more might have helped.</td>', 'There''s just too much else going on in this shot for the blue to really leap out as the subject.  A closer crop, or zooming in more might have helped.', '2006-02-05 02:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123327, 288207, 44611, '<td valign="top">Showing too dark on my monitor to be sure, but this looks a bit soft on focus.  There is also too much in the background distracting from the fairy as the subject.</td>', 'Showing too dark on my monitor to be sure, but this looks a bit soft on focus.  There is also too much in the background distracting from the fairy as the subject.', '2006-02-05 02:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123333, 288854, 44611, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this lake or pond must have been reflecting a rather grey sky!  I see no blue in this shot at all, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Unfortunately this lake or pond must have been reflecting a rather grey sky!  I see no blue in this shot at all, I''m afraid.', '2006-02-05 02:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123338, 289271, 44611, '<td valign="top">Far too out of focus/indistinct.  I''ve taken these shots myself and you really need a tripod to keep the camera steady when using the slower shutter speed necessary to catch the flames without flash.  Good attempt at off-centre composition.</td>', 'Far too out of focus/indistinct.  I''ve taken these shots myself and you really need a tripod to keep the camera steady when using the slower shutter speed necessary to catch the flames without flash.  Good attempt at off-centre composition.', '2006-02-05 03:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123340, 288571, 44611, '<td valign="top">If you hadn''t have told me, I''m not sure I would have known these were denims.  The exposure seems rather harsh too.</td>', 'If you hadn''t have told me, I''m not sure I would have known these were denims.  The exposure seems rather harsh too.', '2006-02-05 03:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123343, 288302, 44611, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a good shot if you had concentrated on the blue grasses only.  Sadly, and particularly because  your base is so yellow, the corn coloured grasses dominate as a subject so much that the blue looks faded and indistinct.</td>', 'I think this could have been a good shot if you had concentrated on the blue grasses only.  Sadly, and particularly because  your base is so yellow, the corn coloured grasses dominate as a subject so much that the blue looks faded and indistinct.', '2006-02-05 03:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123346, 287522, 44611, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but your focus on the drop needed to be much, much sharper to carry this off.</td>', 'Good idea, but your focus on the drop needed to be much, much sharper to carry this off.', '2006-02-05 03:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123347, 288737, 45919, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but this is too "arty" for my liking being all out of focus.  And on my monitors (checked on 2 different PCs) it doesn''t look blue, but very grey.</td>', 'I''m sorry but this is too "arty" for my liking being all out of focus.  And on my monitors (checked on 2 different PCs) it doesn''t look blue, but very grey.', '2006-02-05 03:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123351, 287434, 44611, '<td valign="top">OK, great to have tried the from the top perspective, but the focus is out too much for this to work in this image.  This is compounded by having cut the fourth toothbrush partly out of the frame.  This would have been much better if you had cropped it to concentrate only on the two toothbrushes on the right and improved the focus.</td>', 'OK, great to have tried the from the top perspective, but the focus is out too much for this to work in this image.  This is compounded by having cut the fourth toothbrush partly out of the frame.  This would have been much better if you had cropped it to concentrate only on the two toothbrushes on the right and improved the focus.', '2006-02-05 03:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123354, 289256, 45919, '<td valign="top">Love the shadow effect.</td>', 'Love the shadow effect.', '2006-02-05 03:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123359, 288200, 44611, '<td valign="top">Before you take your shots, particularly posed images like this, have a look round to see if there is anything in the shot that distracts from the main subject.  That piece of litter on the left side of the shot could so easily have been removed.</td>', 'Before you take your shots, particularly posed images like this, have a look round to see if there is anything in the shot that distracts from the main subject.  That piece of litter on the left side of the shot could so easily have been removed.', '2006-02-05 03:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123360, 288409, 44611, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling that this may be a wildlife outake.  Good composition, but very soft on the focus.</td>', 'I have a feeling that this may be a wildlife outake.  Good composition, but very soft on the focus.', '2006-02-05 03:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123363, 287875, 44611, '<td valign="top">Lots of blue, but the subject - highlighted by the title - seems to be the red light.</td>', 'Lots of blue, but the subject - highlighted by the title - seems to be the red light.', '2006-02-05 03:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123373, 289252, 44611, '<td valign="top">Cropping the background out of this would have improved it (you would have needed to make sure your shot of the flag was straight and tight).  Also there seems to be a circular mark in the bottom left quadrant which is distracting.  The light is also a bit harsh and would benefit from being toned down.</td>', 'Cropping the background out of this would have improved it (you would have needed to make sure your shot of the flag was straight and tight).  Also there seems to be a circular mark in the bottom left quadrant which is distracting.  The light is also a bit harsh and would benefit from being toned down.', '2006-02-05 03:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123377, 289153, 44611, '<td valign="top">Is the ivy blue or is it just the way the light has reflected in this image?</td>', 'Is the ivy blue or is it just the way the light has reflected in this image?', '2006-02-05 03:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123383, 288589, 44611, '<td valign="top">Sadly I find this hideous, grotesque, even.  Something about blue and mouths I really don''t like I''m afraid.  Personal taste, I guess some people may love it.</td>', 'Sadly I find this hideous, grotesque, even.  Something about blue and mouths I really don''t like I''m afraid.  Personal taste, I guess some people may love it.', '2006-02-05 03:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123385, 287343, 44611, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I see no blue.</td>', 'Sorry, I see no blue.', '2006-02-05 03:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123386, 286778, 44611, '<td valign="top">Intriguing abstract, but rather confusing.  I think the blue needed to dominate more.</td>', 'Intriguing abstract, but rather confusing.  I think the blue needed to dominate more.', '2006-02-05 03:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2123389, 289116, 44611, '<td valign="top">Focus on the dice is good and clear and the slightly off centre composition is good.  But this falls down on meeting the challenge - the dice, the subject of the image, are not blue.  The background is fundamentally black. There is a very indistinct blue area at the bottom only.</td>', 'Focus on the dice is good and clear and the slightly off centre composition is good.  But this falls down on meeting the challenge - the dice, the subject of the image, are not blue.  The background is fundamentally black. There is a very indistinct blue area at the bottom only.', '2006-02-05 03:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
