(2129911, 287522, 49178, '<td valign="top">Focus is an issue here for me.  And I''m not sure what I''m looking at.  Perhaps a bit more DOF.<br/> <br/>Nice composition of color and shape.</td>', 'Focus is an issue here for me.  And I''m not sure what I''m looking at.  Perhaps a bit more DOF. Nice composition of color and shape.', '2006-02-07 14:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
