(2129916, 288244, 49178, '<td valign="top">I think it would help your image to remove the time stamp.  Perhaps a bit more white to get the image to jump out more.<br/> <br/>Definitely about blue!</td>', 'I think it would help your image to remove the time stamp.  Perhaps a bit more white to get the image to jump out more. Definitely about blue!', '2006-02-07 14:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
