(2131618, 289414, 22734, '<td valign="top">This image is very well lit and the tones are just heavenly. I would have explored overshooting to have found a better position for eye and hair. There is a displacement here and it has nothing to do with the model. It is simply that hair over eyes is always a tricky situation. 7</td>', 'This image is very well lit and the tones are just heavenly. I would have explored overshooting to have found a better position for eye and hair. There is a displacement here and it has nothing to do with the model. It is simply that hair over eyes is always a tricky situation. 7', '2006-02-07 23:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
