(2131747, 288649, 48228, '<td valign="top">"YES"..... You did it again, so, so, deserved..... "CONGRATULATIONS", as I am so PROUD of You. You really "ROCK" mate, "WOW" 54/10''s, super dooper.....This one is now in "MY FAVORITES" along with some of your other great images.....</td>', '"YES"..... You did it again, so, so, deserved..... "CONGRATULATIONS", as I am so PROUD of You. You really "ROCK" mate, "WOW" 54/10''s, super dooper.....This one is now in "MY FAVORITES" along with some of your other great images.....', '2006-02-08 00:28:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2131750, 288649, 5354, '<td valign="top">Congrats Rikki - very well deserved blue</td>', 'Congrats Rikki - very well deserved blue', '2006-02-08 00:29:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2131758, 287004, 49447, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your informative comments.  The flecks are "reflections" as the mask was on a polester velvet and it was highly reflective.  I adjusted the levels as much as I could to get rid of them, but couldn''t get rid of them all without affecting the mask itself.<br/> <br/>I also felt that there might not be enough blue in the photo for some, but I liked it.  Oh well, there''s always the next challenge. :)<br/> <br/>Edited for spelling.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-08 00:31:49.</i></td>', 'Thank you all for your informative comments.  The flecks are "reflections" as the mask was on a polester velvet and it was highly reflective.  I adjusted the levels as much as I could to get rid of them, but couldn''t get rid of them all without affecting the mask itself. I also felt that there might not be enough blue in the photo for some, but I liked it.  Oh well, there''s always the next challenge. :) Edited for spelling.', '2006-02-08 00:30:13.000000', '2006-02-08 00:31:49.000000', 0),
(2131763, 286048, 46591, '<td valign="top">Holy Cow.......I cant believe I got a ribbon:) Of course, I have been asked for the original image, in which I sent just now, but OMG I cant believe it. Since I have become a member, I have been engulfed with creativity, ideas, good and crazy comments, friends and so on. Not only is this the best site of likeminded people, it is professional in it''s checks and balances. Thanks to everyone fo appreciating my image. By the way, this was taken on my balcony at sunset. Post processing included sat, cropping, brightness, and minor shadows.</td>', 'Holy Cow.......I cant believe I got a ribbon:) Of course, I have been asked for the original image, in which I sent just now, but OMG I cant believe it. Since I have become a member, I have been engulfed with creativity, ideas, good and crazy comments, friends and so on. Not only is this the best site of likeminded people, it is professional in it''s checks and balances. Thanks to everyone fo appreciating my image. By the way, this was taken on my balcony at sunset. Post processing included sat, cropping, brightness, and minor shadows.', '2006-02-08 00:31:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2131775, 288649, 48228, '<td valign="top">You took this in your BEDROOM, "WOW" that amazing.....<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sherpet:</b></div><hr/><i> "YES"..... You did it again, so, so, deserved..... "CONGRATULATIONS", as I am so PROUD of You. You really "ROCK" mate, "WOW" 54/10''s, super dooper.....This one is now in "MY FAVORITES" along with some of your other great images..... </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'You took this in your BEDROOM, "WOW" that amazing..... Originally posted by sherpet: "YES"..... You did it again, so, so, deserved..... "CONGRATULATIONS", as I am so PROUD of You. You really "ROCK" mate, "WOW" 54/10''s, super dooper.....This one is now in "MY FAVORITES" along with some of your other great images..... ', '2006-02-08 00:33:25.000000', NULL, 0),
