(2132046, 288649, 6349, '<td valign="top">blue in blue and well deserved.  but share some ribbons with the rest of the class, geez... :) ps. maybe you should think about setting your goal for 7+ on all entries.  6 is obviously too easy for you.  I haven''t had a 7 in a long time.  Those were the good ol'' days.  :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-08 01:08:12.</i></td>', 'blue in blue and well deserved.  but share some ribbons with the rest of the class, geez... :) ps. maybe you should think about setting your goal for 7+ on all entries.  6 is obviously too easy for you.  I haven''t had a 7 in a long time.  Those were the good ol'' days.  :)', '2006-02-08 01:06:35.000000', '2006-02-08 01:08:12.000000', 0),
