(2133075, 287279, 43519, '<td valign="top">I am a little bit sorry about the results of this picture. Maybe I should have given a 10, the picture is simple, the colours look great and the little one standing there makes the picture more attractive (maybe more emotional I don''t know). You can be proud of this shot, it seems to be a spontaneous shot and in my opinion is well above some potential winners. That is an excellent job. I like simple shots, there are the easiest to capture, but generally very efficient.</td>', 'I am a little bit sorry about the results of this picture. Maybe I should have given a 10, the picture is simple, the colours look great and the little one standing there makes the picture more attractive (maybe more emotional I don''t know). You can be proud of this shot, it seems to be a spontaneous shot and in my opinion is well above some potential winners. That is an excellent job. I like simple shots, there are the easiest to capture, but generally very efficient.', '2006-02-08 08:15:52.000000', NULL, 0),
