(2133693, 287158, 50578, '<td valign="top">thanks for all the nice comments. except one.   <br/>For those who asked or wondered. I was focused in on the filament but due to the reflections it appears to be a tad blur, If you look close enough you can see some of the wire in there is in focus. my main concern was getting a nice soft tone blue but really make it pop. I could have shot a different angle to remove reflections but that would have changed the composure of the shot, plus I thought the blue blurs looked sort of like ribbons, I was holding out for some ironic luck.</td>', 'thanks for all the nice comments. except one.   For those who asked or wondered. I was focused in on the filament but due to the reflections it appears to be a tad blur, If you look close enough you can see some of the wire in there is in focus. my main concern was getting a nice soft tone blue but really make it pop. I could have shot a different angle to remove reflections but that would have changed the composure of the shot, plus I thought the blue blurs looked sort of like ribbons, I was holding out for some ironic luck.', '2006-02-08 12:16:26.000000', NULL, 0),
