(2134582, 288649, 35786, '<td valign="top">Awesome Rikki! 5 1''s? I just can''t believe it. Did you set this up against your monitor? The colors are so vibrant! Congrats ...again!!! :0)</td>', 'Awesome Rikki! 5 1''s? I just can''t believe it. Did you set this up against your monitor? The colors are so vibrant! Congrats ...again!!! :0)', '2006-02-08 16:02:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2134736, 288641, 25577, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing how many comments were about an upside down composition.  I was curious to see if this would create interest.  The comments I received expressed just that, whether the person who made the comment knew it or not.  I wonder if I would have received as many comments on a more conservative composition.  How many would have asked me if this was a right side up picture?  So if you liked the picture, me too. If you spent more time looking at this picture figuring out what you were actually looking at, I achieved what I wanted despite the obvious.</td>', 'It''s amazing how many comments were about an upside down composition.  I was curious to see if this would create interest.  The comments I received expressed just that, whether the person who made the comment knew it or not.  I wonder if I would have received as many comments on a more conservative composition.  How many would have asked me if this was a right side up picture?  So if you liked the picture, me too. If you spent more time looking at this picture figuring out what you were actually looking at, I achieved what I wanted despite the obvious.', '2006-02-08 16:28:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2134783, 289187, 42567, '<td valign="top">This is so cool!  Congratulations on your top 20!!</td>', 'This is so cool!  Congratulations on your top 20!!', '2006-02-08 16:44:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2134793, 287133, 27819, '<td valign="top">Yes. This is the Icehotel in Sweden</td>', 'Yes. This is the Icehotel in Sweden', '2006-02-08 16:48:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2134795, 289360, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is a tough shot.  I like that you are experimenting and not afraid to try some stuff.  This is a real balancing act between having too much detail (and ruining the effect) and having too little (and making for a boring picture).  I''d probably like to see a bit more detail or at least a bit more contrast.  I''d also compose the shot with the negative space in front of the face and not behind it.  I think it would be more appealing that way (even a centered composition might work).  I gave it a 4 in the challenge and I think the biggest reason was there just wasn''t enough to hold my interest.  Keep being creative though, it''s a tough thing to do, and it will come with some lumps, but it will make you a better photographer in the end.</td>', 'This is a tough shot.  I like that you are experimenting and not afraid to try some stuff.  This is a real balancing act between having too much detail (and ruining the effect) and having too little (and making for a boring picture).  I''d probably like to see a bit more detail or at least a bit more contrast.  I''d also compose the shot with the negative space in front of the face and not behind it.  I think it would be more appealing that way (even a centered composition might work).  I gave it a 4 in the challenge and I think the biggest reason was there just wasn''t enough to hold my interest.  Keep being creative though, it''s a tough thing to do, and it will come with some lumps, but it will make you a better photographer in the end.', '2006-02-08 16:50:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2134856, 286048, 24454, '<td valign="top">You LIVE there??????   Oh you LUCKY!!!!!   Way to rub it in by sharing this spectacular photo with us.   Congratulations on a very well-deserved ribbon!  It was one of my picks!</td>', 'You LIVE there??????   Oh you LUCKY!!!!!   Way to rub it in by sharing this spectacular photo with us.   Congratulations on a very well-deserved ribbon!  It was one of my picks!', '2006-02-08 17:22:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2134861, 288949, 1717, '<td valign="top">la la la...i beat you! :D<br/> <br/>this is a great shot, hon...i love it!  hope you''re feeling better. *hug*</td>', 'la la la...i beat you! :D this is a great shot, hon...i love it!  hope you''re feeling better. *hug*', '2006-02-08 17:24:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2134883, 286048, 4517, '<td valign="top">Well deserved ribbon. Cracking photo.</td>', 'Well deserved ribbon. Cracking photo.', '2006-02-08 17:33:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2134942, 287089, 33182, '<td valign="top">I agree with colyla, you do look like about 12 years old. I think it''s the innocent look you''ve got on your face. Very nice.</td>', 'I agree with colyla, you do look like about 12 years old. I think it''s the innocent look you''ve got on your face. Very nice.', '2006-02-08 17:55:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135025, 289398, 29011, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments everyone. Placing 4th, I''m thrilled! :)<br/>I had a verion where the small glass sits in between the two taller glasses but I like lines and composition in this one, was more interesting to me this way. I was actually split between the two for some time but glad to have posted this one.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-08 23:03:09.</i></td>', 'Thanks for the comments everyone. Placing 4th, I''m thrilled! :)I had a verion where the small glass sits in between the two taller glasses but I like lines and composition in this one, was more interesting to me this way. I was actually split between the two for some time but glad to have posted this one.', '2006-02-08 18:24:27.000000', '2006-02-08 23:03:09.000000', 0),
(2135055, 289352, 51974, '<td valign="top">This was also my first challenge and I didn''t do so well either. Since I entered a picture, I didn''t think that I should vote. However, if I had, I would have scored this a lot higher than most of these people. I thought it was kind of a cool image.</td>', 'This was also my first challenge and I didn''t do so well either. Since I entered a picture, I didn''t think that I should vote. However, if I had, I would have scored this a lot higher than most of these people. I thought it was kind of a cool image.', '2006-02-08 18:34:33.000000', NULL, 0),
