(2135162, 287336, 50427, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the great comments. Unfortunately, I was unable to come up with the original file from the camera due to one slight mis-step with Photoshop Elements. :(  Newbie, lesson learned.</td>', 'Thanks to all for the great comments. Unfortunately, I was unable to come up with the original file from the camera due to one slight mis-step with Photoshop Elements. :(  Newbie, lesson learned.', '2006-02-08 19:18:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135169, 289370, 15266, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  The composition is very nice and the shot is VERY ad-like. I think the only thing that held it back was the hotspot under the glass.  I understand that it is the light source, but it distracts from the rest of the composition.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  The composition is very nice and the shot is VERY ad-like. I think the only thing that held it back was the hotspot under the glass.  I understand that it is the light source, but it distracts from the rest of the composition.', '2006-02-08 19:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135176, 288649, 42456, '<td valign="top">Maybe I should start loading my camera with dust too!! LOL! <br/>I gave it a 10. Great Job Rikki!!!</td>', 'Maybe I should start loading my camera with dust too!! LOL! I gave it a 10. Great Job Rikki!!!', '2006-02-08 19:25:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135180, 287361, 43434, '<td valign="top">I figured this had to be one of us kiwis ... just that time of year really. Lovely shot!</td>', 'I figured this had to be one of us kiwis ... just that time of year really. Lovely shot!', '2006-02-08 19:26:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135185, 288479, 40718, '<td valign="top">The composition is nice.  I think I''d prefer just a bit tighter on the crop.  The biggest problem is the blue hue makes the wine look very dark and unappealing.  In the end, I just don''t think it''s a good combo, unless you could have backlit the glass with its own light source to bring out some true red.<br/> <br/>EDIT: I came back to say the gradient is pretty sweet.  I forgot to mention that.  I like it.  As far as the unexciting mentioned in other comments, well, I looked at it as a product shot.  It doesn''t have a lot of emotion to it, but it''s a nice enough composition for a wine picture.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-08 19:29:34.</i></td>', 'The composition is nice.  I think I''d prefer just a bit tighter on the crop.  The biggest problem is the blue hue makes the wine look very dark and unappealing.  In the end, I just don''t think it''s a good combo, unless you could have backlit the glass with its own light source to bring out some true red. EDIT: I came back to say the gradient is pretty sweet.  I forgot to mention that.  I like it.  As far as the unexciting mentioned in other comments, well, I looked at it as a product shot.  It doesn''t have a lot of emotion to it, but it''s a nice enough composition for a wine picture.', '2006-02-08 19:28:00.000000', '2006-02-08 19:29:34.000000', 0),
(2135194, 289251, 40718, '<td valign="top">Man, nobody gave you extra points for that song?  I liked it at one point of my life.  Personally I didn''t like the blue cast shots as much as shots with natural light but blue subjects.  Ask yourself this, if you take away the blue, are you left with a shot that says anything?  Not spectacular.  It''s technically well done, but it lacks something for us to really turn over in our minds.</td>', 'Man, nobody gave you extra points for that song?  I liked it at one point of my life.  Personally I didn''t like the blue cast shots as much as shots with natural light but blue subjects.  Ask yourself this, if you take away the blue, are you left with a shot that says anything?  Not spectacular.  It''s technically well done, but it lacks something for us to really turn over in our minds.', '2006-02-08 19:32:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135201, 289370, 26313, '<td valign="top">Thanks Cindi. I was aware of that before I submitted, but I didn''t find it particularly displeasing. I suspect you are right though, that is mainly what held it back. I guess that''s what I get for starting to shoot at 10:30 on Sunday night...</td>', 'Thanks Cindi. I was aware of that before I submitted, but I didn''t find it particularly displeasing. I suspect you are right though, that is mainly what held it back. I guess that''s what I get for starting to shoot at 10:30 on Sunday night...', '2006-02-08 19:35:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135227, 289187, 5112, '<td valign="top">Pretty good finish, mk!  Congratulations, you''re smokin''!</td>', 'Pretty good finish, mk!  Congratulations, you''re smokin''!', '2006-02-08 19:47:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135242, 287062, 41337, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote in this challenge however I probably would have scored it a 5 or a 6. I like the colors and the image as a whole is very pleasing and easy on the eyes. <br/> <br/>As macrothing mentioned the sharpening could be improved. Also the sculpture thing I really don''t get. I understand it''s blue but the fact that it takes up so much real estate and not provide any meaning beyond it''s color I think was a problem for you. If I was to reshoot this I think I would remove the sculpture and also possibly get the background more in focus since it looks like it could enhance the photo and theme further. Really there isn''t much separating this photo from a much better score. Anyway, those are my thoughts.</td>', 'I didn''t vote in this challenge however I probably would have scored it a 5 or a 6. I like the colors and the image as a whole is very pleasing and easy on the eyes.  As macrothing mentioned the sharpening could be improved. Also the sculpture thing I really don''t get. I understand it''s blue but the fact that it takes up so much real estate and not provide any meaning beyond it''s color I think was a problem for you. If I was to reshoot this I think I would remove the sculpture and also possibly get the background more in focus since it looks like it could enhance the photo and theme further. Really there isn''t much separating this photo from a much better score. Anyway, those are my thoughts.', '2006-02-08 19:59:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2135307, 287838, 18552, '<td valign="top">Wow, another great bird picture! I love how the light it catching the edge of the wings. You have really taken a lot of nice bird pictures this week. The sky is really a lovely shade of blue, it looks really rich.</td>', 'Wow, another great bird picture! I love how the light it catching the edge of the wings. You have really taken a lot of nice bird pictures this week. The sky is really a lovely shade of blue, it looks really rich.', '2006-02-08 20:30:39.000000', NULL, 0),
