(2137703, 286048, 21862, '<td valign="top">Yay!  Glad to see Ft. Worth represented... and it looks like it''s a view from the recently converted Bank One building!!!</td>', 'Yay!  Glad to see Ft. Worth represented... and it looks like it''s a view from the recently converted Bank One building!!!', '2006-02-09 17:38:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(2137828, 286482, 72317, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a place I used to live.. And I miss it too.. I also envy this shot a bit because my camera cant take fog, dust, northern lights, or night pictures.. I wish I would have been around to rate this one! It would have been a straight 10 from me.. Nicely done!</td>', 'This reminds me of a place I used to live.. And I miss it too.. I also envy this shot a bit because my camera cant take fog, dust, northern lights, or night pictures.. I wish I would have been around to rate this one! It would have been a straight 10 from me.. Nicely done!', '2006-02-09 18:21:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138058, 286593, 43434, '<td valign="top">Good try for your first challenge.  I think that you have tried to capture something you have seen, and also admitted what you think should have worked better .. I scored this a 5 as it was a good shot with a lovely blue as was the theme for the shoot.</td>', 'Good try for your first challenge.  I think that you have tried to capture something you have seen, and also admitted what you think should have worked better .. I scored this a 5 as it was a good shot with a lovely blue as was the theme for the shoot.', '2006-02-09 19:21:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138074, 288703, 43434, '<td valign="top">Good shot for your first challenge.  Well done.</td>', 'Good shot for your first challenge.  Well done.', '2006-02-09 19:25:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138084, 289352, 43434, '<td valign="top">Amy, good try for a first challenge.  Problem is there is also the first and when a first there is a last.  I think that people have commented in a fair way and have provided a some guidance for your next challenges.  comments like "But nothing in the image is sharp" is quite true, a lot of people will look for the one focus point in the photo to bring the image to life.  I think you have a good eye and can''t wait to see as you progress!<br/> <br/>Kari</td>', 'Amy, good try for a first challenge.  Problem is there is also the first and when a first there is a last.  I think that people have commented in a fair way and have provided a some guidance for your next challenges.  comments like "But nothing in the image is sharp" is quite true, a lot of people will look for the one focus point in the photo to bring the image to life.  I think you have a good eye and can''t wait to see as you progress! Kari', '2006-02-09 19:26:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2138145, 288649, 49561, '<td valign="top">Wow! Just saw the front page and this is incredible! Congrats. Two blue ribbons in two weeks. Got to save some for us :)</td>', 'Wow! Just saw the front page and this is incredible! Congrats. Two blue ribbons in two weeks. Got to save some for us :)', '2006-02-09 19:34:57.000000', NULL, 0),
