(2144906, 285838, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this shot very much.  The ripples in the water add a nice texture.  The lighting (flash, maybe?) creates a shadow of the drop which detracts from the overall flow of the picture.  Good job getting the motion on the water surface and the drop falling!</td>', 'I like the idea behind this shot very much.  The ripples in the water add a nice texture.  The lighting (flash, maybe?) creates a shadow of the drop which detracts from the overall flow of the picture.  Good job getting the motion on the water surface and the drop falling!', '2006-02-12 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
