(2147821, 287186, 10858, '<td valign="top">I have been lurking around this one a lot and thinking why I did not get it. I guess it was because of the purple. I am honest, although it''s strange, but the more I look at this one, the more I like it. Maybe not for Blue II, but as a simple shot. Thanks for making me think about this shot.</td>', 'I have been lurking around this one a lot and thinking why I did not get it. I guess it was because of the purple. I am honest, although it''s strange, but the more I look at this one, the more I like it. Maybe not for Blue II, but as a simple shot. Thanks for making me think about this shot.', '2006-02-13 16:45:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2148969, 288982, 42638, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Critique Club</b> <br/> <br/>I like the idea, the shapes made create a very nice abstract. The lighting is a bit harsh from the middle to the left but perfect on the right side. The shadows made on that side are very interesting. The color makes this true to challenge but is just a tad flat. I think the biggest thing that throws me on this picture is the lack of main subject, my eyes keep dancing around trying to pinpoint what it is you want me to see. With all the curves and lines made, it really creates good motion but it doesn''t lead anywhere. I believe for this challenge and these voters, its a bit too abstract (and a great one at that).<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club  I like the idea, the shapes made create a very nice abstract. The lighting is a bit harsh from the middle to the left but perfect on the right side. The shadows made on that side are very interesting. The color makes this true to challenge but is just a tad flat. I think the biggest thing that throws me on this picture is the lack of main subject, my eyes keep dancing around trying to pinpoint what it is you want me to see. With all the curves and lines made, it really creates good motion but it doesn''t lead anywhere. I believe for this challenge and these voters, its a bit too abstract (and a great one at that).', '2006-02-14 00:11:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2149357, 289102, 34481, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling this picture evokes.  I disagree with other commentors that it is uninteresting or lacks a focal point.  I like the colors, the light, and the tranquility.  It was way underrated.</td>', 'I like the feeling this picture evokes.  I disagree with other commentors that it is uninteresting or lacks a focal point.  I like the colors, the light, and the tranquility.  It was way underrated.', '2006-02-14 06:25:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(2149520, 289238, 43519, '<td valign="top">This is a shame that the picture did not reach an higher score. I have seen worse pictures reaching much higher positions. The picture should have passed at least an average of 5.8. In my opinion, it was very much underated. Yes, I can see two spots (ccd dust), but not a big deal. Good job.<br/> <br/>Max</td>', 'This is a shame that the picture did not reach an higher score. I have seen worse pictures reaching much higher positions. The picture should have passed at least an average of 5.8. In my opinion, it was very much underated. Yes, I can see two spots (ccd dust), but not a big deal. Good job. Max', '2006-02-14 09:11:42.000000', NULL, 0),
