(2154060, 288261, 38267, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery and good exposure on this shot considering the wide range of dark and light.  The sensor dust definitely takes away from the picture, but I know you can''t clone with the basic rules.  I''d suggest that you definitely clone the various dust spots for this picture now that the challenge is over.</td>', 'Nice scenery and good exposure on this shot considering the wide range of dark and light.  The sensor dust definitely takes away from the picture, but I know you can''t clone with the basic rules.  I''d suggest that you definitely clone the various dust spots for this picture now that the challenge is over.', '2006-02-15 14:24:38.000000', NULL, 0),
