(2156660, 289100, 27373, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by AdrienneGC:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vxpra:</b></div><hr/><i> Will you run away with me?  But we\''ll have to run fast or else my fiance\'' will catch up and beat the crud out of me.  :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for adding my photo to your favorites!  That\''s quite a compliment:) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It is a really nice shot, I love the subdued colors and the cropping is excellent.  The only small problem is the blown out light on the right side and I think that actually works with this particular shot.</td>', 'Originally posted by AdrienneGC: Originally posted by vxpra: Will you run away with me?  But we\''ll have to run fast or else my fiance\'' will catch up and beat the crud out of me.  :)   Thank you for adding my photo to your favorites!  That\''s quite a compliment:)   It is a really nice shot, I love the subdued colors and the cropping is excellent.  The only small problem is the blown out light on the right side and I think that actually works with this particular shot.', '2006-02-16 12:29:30.000000', NULL, 0),
