(2189238, 286655, 48298, '<td valign="top">Just to show that voting is all subjective, this 5.051 scored photo was just selected as Kodak POTD for 3-10-06 and will be featured on the Times Square billboard in NYC.  :)  Lesson learned:  If you know that YOU like your photos, don''t worry what anyone else thinks!<br/>Thank you all for your comments.  :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-03-01 09:43:55.</i></td>', 'Just to show that voting is all subjective, this 5.051 scored photo was just selected as Kodak POTD for 3-10-06 and will be featured on the Times Square billboard in NYC.  :)  Lesson learned:  If you know that YOU like your photos, don''t worry what anyone else thinks!Thank you all for your comments.  :)', '2006-02-28 08:17:23.000000', '2006-03-01 09:43:55.000000', 0),
(2200848, 289030, 18367, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmmmmmmm seems my comments were cut off.  What I had wanted to say was that I truly liked this shot.  <br/> <br/>Unlike some who found the image "boring", I found the simplicity simply stunning.  Taking a photo of a pristine venue and getting the audience to share your love of the image is, in most instances a relatively easy task.<br/> <br/>What you have done here is take a very ordinary item, and display it in a striking manner.<br/> <br/>This was one of my favorite photos in the competition, and well deserving the placement it got.<br/> <br/>The very best to you in your future endeavours.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'Hmmmmmmmmmm seems my comments were cut off.  What I had wanted to say was that I truly liked this shot.   Unlike some who found the image "boring", I found the simplicity simply stunning.  Taking a photo of a pristine venue and getting the audience to share your love of the image is, in most instances a relatively easy task. What you have done here is take a very ordinary item, and display it in a striking manner. This was one of my favorite photos in the competition, and well deserving the placement it got. The very best to you in your future endeavours. Ray', '2006-03-04 23:47:13.000000', NULL, 0),
