(2242198, 288667, 27845, '<td valign="top">I am impressed by your mental ability to see things as what they can be. I would have walked by and not even noticed the abstract possibilities of framing and flipping the given. The perspective is overwhelming, so is the contrast between patterned colour areas, gradiented surfaces and pitch black blocks.</td>', 'I am impressed by your mental ability to see things as what they can be. I would have walked by and not even noticed the abstract possibilities of framing and flipping the given. The perspective is overwhelming, so is the contrast between patterned colour areas, gradiented surfaces and pitch black blocks.', '2006-03-20 16:25:22.000000', NULL, 0),
