(2547051, 287606, 16912, '<td valign="top">Coming from my <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=336521&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">1-4-0</a>  thread ...<br/> <br/>First off well done submitting your first shot (its difficult to do). Now you have submitted more do I really need to comment?<br/> <br/>Titles for me are not often important when voting but if this were called ''40'' rather than what you chose I think it would have worked better? <br/> <br/>Being honest its a rather bland image and worthy of its 4.7 ;) (my first was a 4.2:)</td>', 'Coming from my 1-4-0  thread ... First off well done submitting your first shot (its difficult to do). Now you have submitted more do I really need to comment? Titles for me are not often important when voting but if this were called ''40'' rather than what you chose I think it would have worked better?  Being honest its a rather bland image and worthy of its 4.7 ;) (my first was a 4.2:)', '2006-06-23 22:42:32.000000', NULL, 0),
