(2819678, 286084, 19944, '<td valign="top">Hey!  You''re standing in my personal reserved spot!<br/> <br/>And I see you got the crooked horizon comment.  I''ve entered a couple Concord Point shots and gotten them, even the the horizon is straight (notice the trees stright up and down?).  I think it''s just the lay of the land that gives the illusion.<br/> <br/>Nice colors, I love sunrise there.  I have gone the last two New Years mornings for the "first light of the year".  Weather permitting, I''ll do it every year from now on.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-09-10 07:12:57.</i></td>', 'Hey!  You''re standing in my personal reserved spot! And I see you got the crooked horizon comment.  I''ve entered a couple Concord Point shots and gotten them, even the the horizon is straight (notice the trees stright up and down?).  I think it''s just the lay of the land that gives the illusion. Nice colors, I love sunrise there.  I have gone the last two New Years mornings for the "first light of the year".  Weather permitting, I''ll do it every year from now on.', '2006-09-10 08:12:14.000000', '2006-09-10 08:12:57.000000', 0),
